  "content": "<center><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Antikythera-Studios/atk-resources/main/pages/data/epic-fight/assets/banner.png\" alt=\"Epic Fight banner\"></center>\n\n<center><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Antikythera-Studios/atk-resources/main/pages/data/epic-fight/assets/divider.png\" alt=\"divider\"></center>\n\n<center>\n  <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/bePatron?u=53051224\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Antikythera-Studios/atk-resources/main/pages/shared/icons/patreon.png\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" /></a>\n  <a href=\"https://discord.com/invite/NbAJwj8RHg\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Antikythera-Studios/atk-resources/main/pages/shared/icons/discord.png\" alt=\"Discord\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" /></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@yesman4100\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Antikythera-Studios/atk-resources/main/pages/shared/icons/youtube.png\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" /></a>\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/Antikythera-Studios/epicfight\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Antikythera-Studios/atk-resources/main/pages/shared/icons/github.png\" alt=\"GitHub\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" /></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-fight-mod\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Antikythera-Studios/atk-resources/main/pages/shared/icons/curseforge.png\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" /></a>\n</center>\n\n<center><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Antikythera-Studios/atk-resources/main/pages/data/epic-fight/assets/divider.png\" alt=\"divider\"></center>\n\n## Epic Fight\n\n<center><em>Epic Fight 為您的遊戲增添了複雜的遊戲機制和戰鬥風格。融合了一絲「魂系」戰鬥元素以及獨特且打破常規的動畫處理方式，Epic Fight 將把您的遊戲體驗提升至全新層次，並帶來一系列令人興奮的新挑戰。</em></center>\n\n**新機制：** 您將面對一種全新的 Minecraft 戰鬥體驗，所有實體都擁有了全新且具有挑戰性的戰鬥機制。Epic Fight 徹底重構了遊戲，引入了來自 FromSoftware 旗下《黑暗靈魂》系列、《隻狼：暗影雙死》及《艾爾登法環》等著名作品的「魂系」戰鬥風格。\n\n**難度：** Epic Fight 起初可能看起來令人望而生畏，特別是對於從未體驗過「魂系」戰鬥挑戰的玩家而言。然而，Epic Fight 旨在讓所有玩家都能享受。我們確保提供了多種武器和技能，讓每位玩家都能找到適合自己的遊玩風格。\n\n<center><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Antikythera-Studios/atk-resources/main/pages/data/epic-fight/assets/divider.png\" alt=\"divider\"></center>\n\n## ✨ 特色\n\n- **魂系戰鬥** - 探索一個擁有全新實體行為、挑戰和可製作物品的世界！\n- **技能** - 發現、學習並精通酷炫的新能力，解鎖與敵人作戰的全新方式！\n- **新武器** - 製作擁有不同技能和玩法的酷炫新武器！\n- **靈活性** - Epic Fight 具有極高的可配置性，嘗試所有不同的配置選項以調整至您滿意的狀態！\n- **好友** - 單獨享受該模組或與朋友一起，組成突襲小隊並共同探索！\n\n<center><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Antikythera-Studios/atk-resources/main/pages/data/epic-fight/assets/divider.png\" alt=\"divider\"></center>\n\n## 📷 媒體\n\n<center><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Antikythera-Studios/atk-resources/main/pages/data/epic-fight/assets/ZZZZZZZZZ1.png\" alt=\"media\"></center>\n\n<center><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Antikythera-Studios/atk-resources/main/pages/data/epic-fight/assets/1827189298.png\" alt=\"media\"></center>\n\n<center><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Antikythera-Studios/atk-resources/main/pages/data/epic-fight/assets/207981072389172389.png\" alt=\"media\"></center>\n\n<center><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Antikythera-Studios/atk-resources/main/pages/data/epic-fight/assets/divider.png\" alt=\"divider\"></center>\n\n## 📥 安裝\n\n**需要客戶端和服務端！**\n\n<center><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Antikythera-Studios/atk-resources/main/pages/data/epic-fight/assets/divider.png\" alt=\"divider\"></center>\n\n## ⚙️ 配置\n\n大多數選項可以在遊戲內更改 - 無需重新啟動。打開 **模組 → Epic Fight → 配置**，或直接編輯 `.minecraft/config/epicfight-common.toml` 中的配置文件。\n\n> **提示：** 對配置文件的修改在下次加載世界時生效。\n\n<center><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Antikythera-Studios/atk-resources/main/pages/data/epic-fight/assets/divider.png\" alt=\"divider\"></center>\n\n## ❤️ 致謝\n\n由 **Antikythera Studios** 精心製作。\n\n- **代碼與美術** - Antikythera Studios 團隊\n- **翻譯** - blade_master_x, nameed, smokingbastard, luke_nogami, xablauler, a_k1m0, requiem4, shape.nan, ig114514, andy852546, kevinl2000, icewolf8964, yesman_0, kilotheneko, banikula, majmun.boy 及許多其他合作者。\n\n喜歡這個模組嗎？在存儲庫上給個 ⭐ 並在 Modrinth / CurseForge 上推薦該模組，其幫助比您想像的還要大。\n\n<center><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Antikythera-Studios/atk-resources/main/pages/data/epic-fight/assets/divider.png\" alt=\"divider\"></center>\n\n<center><a href=\"https://billing.sparkedhost.com/aff.php?aff=2724\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Antikythera-Studios/atk-resources/main/pages/data/epic-fight/assets/support.png\" alt=\"Support & Affiliates\"></a></center>",
